erous case | 2026-09-01.md | 2026-09-01 |\n| [[connections/reviewers-cannot-audit-decision-order]] | Layered differently-focused review catches artifact defects but is structurally blind to post-hoc threshold selection, which only a verifiable timestamp can guard. | adjudicated | 2026-09-06 |\n| [[connections/durable-log-is-the-contract-for-scheduled-work]] | Relocating hours-scale work from a session to a scheduler solves lifetime but hands scope to a drifting manifest and truth to a lagging status field, leaving the durable log as the only faithful contract. | adjudicated | 2026-09-06 |\n| [[concepts/tmux-vscode-integrated-terminal-setup]] | tmux in VS Code on macOS: `Ctrl+b` sidebar collision fixed via `commandsToSkipShell` `-` prefix, `+`-button new-session root cause for missing splits, first `~/.tmux.conf` | 2026-09-04.md | 2026-09-07 |\n| [[concepts/dcg-guard-false-positives-native-tool-workaround]] | Adds two new blocked shapes (inline PowerShell via Bash, compound Bash command) and their decomposition workarounds | 2026-09-04.md, 2026-09-07.md, 2026-09-11.md | 2026-09-12 |\n| [[concepts/vendored-skill-hand-install-pattern]] | 53 of 58 `davidondrej/skills` rejected in four categories, 5 hand-installed (151→156) via `~/.agents/skills` → Claude → Codex symlinks; absent from `.skill-lock.json` so `skills update` can't see them | 2026-09-04.md | 2026-09-07 |\n| [[concepts/on-demand-backup-skill-and-ssd-completeness]] | Adds the mechanism behind the job-count tell (`CAPTURE`/`STATE-SSD` classes exist only when mounted), verified against 13:25 vs 13:46 runs and written into `SKILL.md` | 2026-09-04.md, 2026-09-07.md | 2026-09-07 |\n| [[concepts/memory-cap-relief-by-migration-not-deletion]] | Adds a third same-evening cap trim (2,531→2,496) and reframes relief as the paired half of writing a Tier A fact rather than a periodic emergency | 2026-09-04.md, 2026-09-07.md | 2026-09-07 |\n| [[concepts/docker-desktop-uninstall-residue-macos]] | Seven Docker Desktop leftover